WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.450
Jamie dashes after the light-Arrow prerequisite.

2
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:00.850
Jamie completes the second dash near Ryu’s rise.

3
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.150
Ryu’s throw misses as Jamie retreats.

4
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.700
Crouching medium punch punishes the throw recovery.

5
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.300
Standing medium kick links after crouching medium.

6
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.700
OD Swagger Step launches Ryu.

7
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.400
The sweep target kick extends the juggle.

8
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.150
Jamie drinks after the sweep target.
